{"id":49966,"date":"2026-03-14T20:16:13","date_gmt":"2026-03-14T19:16:13","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=49966"},"modified":"2026-09-02T21:51:59","modified_gmt":"2026-09-02T20:51:59","slug":"azores-hybrid-race","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/azores-hybrid-race\/","title":{"rendered":"Azores Hybrid Race 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Azores Hybrid Race 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Azores Hybrid Race 2026<\/strong> realiza-se nos dias <strong>17 e 18 de Outubro de 2026<\/strong> no prestigiado complexo das <strong>Portas do Mar<\/strong>, em <strong>Ponta Delgada<\/strong>, na <strong>Ilha de S\u00e3o Miguel, A\u00e7ores<\/strong>. Organizada pelo clube <strong>Ilh\u00e9us Impactantes<\/strong>, a prova traz ao arquip\u00e9lago a emo\u00e7\u00e3o do formato de fitness h\u00edbrido baseado nos padr\u00f5es internacionais HYROX.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A competi\u00e7\u00e3o desafia os atletas com <strong>8 km de corrida intervalada (8 x 1 km)<\/strong> intercalados com <strong>8 esta\u00e7\u00f5es de for\u00e7a e resist\u00eancia<\/strong> (SkiErg, Sled Push, Sled Pull, Burpee Broad Jumps, Remo, Farmer Carry, Sandbag Lunges e Wall Balls). Com categorias individuais (Singles Pro e Open), Duplas (Doubles) e Estafetas de 4 elementos (Relay), o evento proporciona uma experi\u00eancia desportiva de pura supera\u00e7\u00e3o atl\u00e9tica.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">17 e 18 de Outubro de 2026 \u00e0s 09:00<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 